# =====================================================================
# 换行符与二进制文件规则
# =====================================================================

# 仓库内统一以 LF 存储，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 混编产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须用 CRLF，否则命令行解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell 脚本必须用 LF，否则在 Linux/macOS 上无法执行
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制文件，禁止行尾转换与文本合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
